1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,133
Pernah nggak sih kepikiran,

2
00:00:03,133 --> 00:00:06,700
gimana kalau setiap mulai kerja,

3
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:11,833
semua aplikasi langsung kebuka sendiri

4
00:00:11,833 --> 00:00:17,000
tanpa harus buka satu-satu?

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,267
Kayaknya praktis banget, kan?

6
00:00:19,267 --> 00:00:21,033
Tapi... emang bisa?

7
00:00:21,033 --> 00:00:23,700
Jawabannya bisa!

8
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:31,033
Pertama, siapkan shortcut

9
00:00:31,033 --> 00:00:33,233
aplikasi atau file yang mau

10
00:00:33,233 --> 00:00:35,333
dibuka otomatis.

11
00:00:35,333 --> 00:00:37,533
Kalau belum ada, cari aplikasi

12
00:00:37,533 --> 00:00:39,667
atau filenya di File Explorer,

13
00:00:39,667 --> 00:00:42,000
klik kanan, pilih Send to,

14
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:44,500
lalu Desktop.

15
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:47,333
Selanjutnya, tekan Windows + R,

16
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:51,200
ketik shell titik dua startup,

17
00:00:51,200 --> 00:00:54,500
lalu Enter.

18
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,700
Nah, tinggal copy shortcut tadi,

19
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,900
lalu paste ke folder Startup

20
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:03,500
yang terbuka.

21
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,867
Selesai! Sekarang, setiap kali login Windows,

22
00:01:06,867 --> 00:01:09,667
aplikasi atau file tadi bakal kebuka sendiri.

23
00:01:09,667 --> 00:01:12,200
Nah, kalau kamu, aplikasi apa

24
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:14,667
yang paling sering dibuka pas mulai kerja?

25
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:16,500
Coba tulis di komentar!
